<title>TURKEY: Turkish 392-day t-bond yield rises to 125.45 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkish 392-day t-bond yield rises to 125.45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 392-day T-bond yield rose to 125.45 percent on Tuesday, up 1.79 points from the previous 392-day bond auction on December 17.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    : Jan 21, 1998</p>
<p>	Amount			: 69.27 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     : 125.45</p>
<p>	Average yield	     : -</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  : 177.2 trln</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   : 41,666 lira</p>
<p>Pct allocated at lowest price : -</p>
<p>	Payment date		: December 25, 1996</p>
